{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1779100514_5306662_1a88eb51c4e8b21da1d204dcb637993f.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;font-size:15px;color:rgb(16,18,54);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:center;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(246,245,242);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">A fusion of history and tradition through scent.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 10px;font-size:15px;color:rgb(16,18,54);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:center;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(246,245,242);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">Jana Aromas, which was founded in Kuwait in 2020, is a lifestyle brand that leads the industry in providing clients with clean, natural goods, some of which are merged with classic traditional aromas. Our company's basic beliefs are firmly anchored in sustainability, and we go to great lengths to ensure that each of our items is manufactured by hand using materials from sources we can be proud of. All of our candles are made with natural soy wax and our aromatic ma’mouls are hand-mixed using a valued family recipe that has been handed down through three generations. All of our items are free from toxins and animal testing, and the vast majority of their packaging and labels are compostable.</p></div>",
